WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.150
Grok is helpful, but it can be wrong.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.950
After any important answer, ask:

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.250
which parts are you least sure about?

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.610
And always read anything before it goes to a customer,

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.483
a bank, or the government.

